wilcomp-tv-ffmpeg
FFmpeg audio decoder extension used by the Wilcomp TV Android app.
Copyright 2026 Wilcomp S.A.S.

This repository contains everything needed to rebuild libffmpegJNI.so, the
native library of the Wilcomp TV app that contains FFmpeg: the JNI wrapper,
the build scripts, the patches and the exact FFmpeg source code (published as
a GitHub Release asset).

